capability property/lists  a list of any element, its length in a range
  heroes  property.many, property.more, property.int_lists
  go      -
  rust    proptest::collection::vec, vec_deque, linked_list, binary_heap, proptest::array::uniform, uniform1 to uniform32
  python  hypothesis.strategies.lists, hypothesis.strategies.iterables
  haskell listOf, listOf1, vectorOf, vector, NonEmptyList, NonEmpty, getNonEmpty
  note    a list of any element is the generator's own loop, `while property.more(@s, @count)?`, since a generator passed as a value cannot advance the source of the one that calls it; `more` reads one choice an element and 0 ends the list, Hypothesis's `many`, so a deleted element is a shorter list

capability property/maps  a map or a set of drawn keys
