capability property/records  a value of the program's own type built from draws, dependent draws included
  heroes  property.Source, property.check
  go      quick.Generator
  rust    proptest::prop_compose!, Strategy::prop_map, Strategy::prop_map_into, Strategy::prop_flat_map, Strategy::prop_ind_flat_map, Strategy::prop_ind_flat_map2, Strategy::prop_filter_map, proptest::strategy::Just, proptest::strategy::LazyJust, proptest::strategy::Map, MapInto, Flatten, IndFlatten, IndFlattenMap, FilterMap, LazyJustFn
  python  hypothesis.strategies.builds, hypothesis.strategies.composite, hypothesis.strategies.data, hypothesis.strategies.DataObject, hypothesis.strategies.DrawFn, hypothesis.strategies.tuples, hypothesis.strategies.shared, SearchStrategy.map, SearchStrategy.flatmap
  haskell Gen, applyArbitrary2, applyArbitrary3, applyArbitrary4, (><)
  note    a generator is a top-level function from `Source` to `T?` that copies its source into a cell and draws each field through `@source`, calling helpers of its own with the same `@source`; a dependent draw is a draw that reads an earlier one, and a map is code after the draws (the driver `reach_property.hero` shows the shape)

